sequenceDiagram
    participant KF as KubeFlow (Tenant)
    participant KAI as KAI Scheduler
    participant GO as GPU Operator
    participant MP as mig-parted Daemon
    participant GPU as H100 Physical GPU

    KF->>KAI: Request Notebook (1x 1g.10gb MIG Slice)
    KAI->>KAI: Check available 1g.10gb slices in Pool 3
    alt No slices available
        KAI->>GO: Request Dynamic Reconfiguration
        GO->>MP: Drain 1 Idle GPU & Re-partition
        MP->>GPU: Tear down existing slices
        GPU-->>MP: Clean state
        MP->>GPU: Apply profile: 7x 1g.10gb
        GPU-->>GO: 7 new slices ready
        GO-->>KAI: Capacity added
    end
    KAI->>CP: Schedule Pod to Node
    CP->>GPU: Mount 1g.10gb slice into Pod
    Note over KF, GPU: Notebook running on isolated hardware slice
